{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71817","main_id":71817,"main_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","main_description":"海灯节期间，望舒客栈里的工作让言笑有些不堪重负…","chapter_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7181701,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181701,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":718170104,"next_line_ids":[718170105],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":1702518330,"text":"现在我没闲功夫跟你说话，得赶紧准备着，等晚上客人都来点菜了，我估计水都赶不上喝。","raw_text":"现在我没闲功夫跟你说话，得赶紧准备着，等晚上客人都来点菜了，我估计水都赶不上喝。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181701.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71817","main_id":71817,"main_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","main_description":"海灯节期间，望舒客栈里的工作让言笑有些不堪重负…","chapter_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7181701,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181701,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":718170105,"next_line_ids":[718170106],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":2102866434,"text":"你既然这么热心来关心我，那干脆晚上来帮忙吧。","raw_text":"你既然这么热心来关心我，那干脆晚上来帮忙吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181701.json"}
