{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71817","main_id":71817,"main_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","main_description":"海灯节期间，望舒客栈里的工作让言笑有些不堪重负…","chapter_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7181702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181702,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":718170205,"next_line_ids":[718170206],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":2514412306,"text":"海灯节期间，客栈里的人差不多都回去过节了，没多少能干活的人手，我们都忙得不可开交，多一个人来帮忙都是好事。","raw_text":"海灯节期间，客栈里的人差不多都回去过节了，没多少能干活的人手，我们都忙得不可开交，多一个人来帮忙都是好事。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181702.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71817","main_id":71817,"main_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","main_description":"海灯节期间，望舒客栈里的工作让言笑有些不堪重负…","chapter_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7181702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181702,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":718170206,"next_line_ids":[718170207],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":3091921466,"text":"你也不用太担心，不用你帮什么重活，只要你帮忙上上菜、采购点材料就行了。","raw_text":"你也不用太担心，不用你帮什么重活，只要你帮忙上上菜、采购点材料就行了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181702.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71817","main_id":71817,"main_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","main_description":"海灯节期间，望舒客栈里的工作让言笑有些不堪重负…","chapter_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7181702,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181702,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":718170207,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":3113099962,"text":"你等会啊，我瞧瞧，现在有什么可以叫你帮忙的…","raw_text":"你等会啊，我瞧瞧，现在有什么可以叫你帮忙的…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181702.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-71817","main_id":71817,"main_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","main_description":"海灯节期间，望舒客栈里的工作让言笑有些不堪重负…","chapter_title":"言笑的喧闹厨房","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":7181703,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7181703,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":718170301,"next_line_ids":[718170302],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":2100229018,"text":"哎哟，都给我忙忘了，楼下那桌客人的菜还没点。","raw_text":"哎哟，都给我忙忘了，楼下那桌客人的菜还没点。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7181703.json"}
